{"feed":{"updated":"2026-11-14T21:46:35.421Z","id":"https://cmr.earthdata.nasa.gov:443/search/collections.json?short_name=SPL4SMAU&page_size=5","title":"ECHO dataset metadata","entry":[{"processing_level_id":"4","cloud_hosted":true,"boxes":["-85.044 -180 85.044 180"],"has_combine":false,"time_start":"2015-03-31T00:00:00.000Z","version_id":"008","updated":"2026-10-20T22:34:30.000Z","dataset_id":"SMAP L4 Global 3-hourly 9 km EASE-Grid Surface and Root Zone Soil Moisture Analysis Update V008","entry_id":"SPL4SMAU_008","has_spatial_subsetting":true,"has_transforms":true,"associations":{"variables":["V3707346525-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346390-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346492-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346330-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346324-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346478-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346328-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346320-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346482-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346306-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346336-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346364-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346504-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346613-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346342-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346352-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346424-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346495-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346379-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346338-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346441-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346332-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346519-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346322-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346318-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346300-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346344-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346500-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346315-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346312-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346552-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346512-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346472-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346413-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346340-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346598-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346326-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346537-NSIDC_CPRD","V3707346334-NSIDC_CPRD"],"services":["S2472217299-NSIDC_CPRD","S3671941188-XYZ_PROV","S3107386427-NSIDC_CPRD","S3213793274-NSIDC_CPRD"],"tools":["TL4019526230-NSIDC_CPRD","TL4019517520-NSIDC_CPRD","TL3010466318-NSIDC_CPRD","TL4019511337-NSIDC_CPRD"],"citations":["CIT4321026844-ESDIS","CIT4321030594-ESDIS","CIT4106688174-ESDIS","CIT4321026781-ESDIS","CIT3857566770-ESDIS","CIT4201246886-ESDIS"],"visualizations":["VIS3660440558-ESDIS","VIS3660440725-ESDIS","VIS3660440678-ESDIS","VIS3660440712-ESDIS","VIS3660440622-ESDIS"]},"has_variables":true,"data_center":"NSIDC_CPRD","short_name":"SPL4SMAU","organizations":["NASA NSIDC DAAC","NASA/GSFC/SED/ESD/GMAO"],"title":"SMAP L4 Global 3-hourly 9 km EASE-Grid Surface and Root Zone Soil Moisture Analysis Update V008","coordinate_system":"CARTESIAN","summary":"SMAP Level-4 (L4) surface and root zone soil moisture (L4_SM) data are provided in three products. \n\nThe SMAP L4 Global 3-hourly 9 km EASE-Grid Surface and Root Zone Soil Moisture Geophysical Data (SPL4SMGP, DOI: 10.5067/T5RUATAQREF8) product is a series of 3-hourly time average geophysical land surface fields that are output by the L4_SM algorithm. It is likely of primary interest to most users. \n\nThe SMAP L4 Global 3-hourly 9 km EASE-Grid Surface and Root Zone Soil Moisture Analysis Update (SPL4SMAU, DOI: 10.5067/02LGW4DGJYRX) product provides diagnostics from the land surface analysis updates. It consists of a series of 3-hourly instantaneous (or snapshot) files that contain the assimilated SMAP observations, the corresponding land model predictions and analysis estimates, and additional data assimilation diagnostics. \n\nLastly, the SMAP L4 Global 9 km EASE-Grid Surface and Root Zone Soil Moisture Land Model Constants (SPL4SMLM, DOI: 10.5067/PXQIBL2ALDZD) product provides static (time-invariant) land surface model constants that will be needed by some users for further interpretation of the geophysical land surface fields. This product consists of only one granule (file) per L4_SM data product version (as defined by a distinct Science Version ID). \n\nFor each product, SMAP L-band brightness temperature data from descending and ascending half-orbit satellite passes (approximately 6:00 a.m. and 6:00 p.m. local solar time, respectively) are assimilated into a land surface model that is gridded using an Earth-fixed, global cylindrical 9 km Equal-Area Scalable Earth Grid, Version 2.0 (EASE-Grid 2.0) projection.","service_features":{"harmony":{"has_formats":true,"has_variables":true,"has_transforms":true,"has_combine":false,"has_spatial_subsetting":true,"has_temporal_subsetting":false},"opendap":{"has_formats":false,"has_variables":false,"has_transforms":false,"has_combine":false,"has_spatial_subsetting":false,"has_temporal_subsetting":false},"esi":{"has_formats":false,"has_variables":false,"has_transforms":false,"has_combine":false,"has_spatial_subsetting":false,"has_temporal_subsetting":false}},"orbit_parameters":{},"id":"C3480440639-NSIDC_CPRD","has_formats":true,"consortiums":["GEOSS","EOSDIS"],"original_format":"ISO19115","archive_center":"NASA NSIDC DAAC","has_temporal_subsetting":false,"browse_flag":true,"platforms":["GEOS-5","SMAP"],"association_details":{"variables":[{"concept_id":"V3707346525-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346390-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346492-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346330-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346324-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346478-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346328-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346320-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346482-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346306-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346336-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346364-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346504-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346613-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346342-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346352-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346424-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346495-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346379-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346338-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346441-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346332-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346519-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346322-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346318-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346300-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346344-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346500-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346315-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3707346312-NSIDC_CPRD"},{"concept_id":"V3